# Paths secretlint skips.
#
# Deliberately NOT .gitignore. Using .gitignore here would create a blind spot:
# .env.* is gitignored, so a force-added (`git add -f`) env file would never be
# scanned — exactly the case the scanner exists to catch.
# Only genuine build artefacts and vendored code belong in this file.

node_modules/**
dist/**
coverage/**
.turbo/**
pnpm-lock.yaml
.git/**
